XSLT "eXtensible Stylesheet Language Transformations" functional programming language in XML for specifying conversion of input XML to output format (more in \cite{nutshellXML})
JOP "Unified Control Center" control system enabling monitoring of multiple stations at once
M\&S "Modeling and Simulation" see section \ref{modelling}
DOM "Document Object Model" more in \cite{nutshellXML}
SAX "Simple API for XML" more in \cite{nutshellXML}
GCC "GNU Compiler Collection" \url{http://www.gnu.org/software/gcc/}
STL "Standard Template Library" library functions of C++ language
PS "Petri Net" see section \ref{modelling}
SIMLIB "SIMLIB/C++" \url{http://www.fit.vutbr.cz/~peringer/SIMLIB/}
AB "Automatic Block" track interlocking system divided into spatial sections
